+          "quote": "Let $S\\in C^1([0,T];\\mathbb R^{d\\times m})$ and $p\\in C^1([0,T];\\mathbb R^d)$ satisfy $S'=A S+B$ and $p'=-A^T p-g$, where $A,B,g$ are continuous and have compatible dimensions. Then\n$$p(T)^T S(T)-p(0)^T S(0)=\\int_0^T\\bigl(-g(t)^T S(t)+p(t)^T B(t)\\bigr)\\,dt.$$",
